    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"15930\" class=\"elementor elementor-15930\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5273ec4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5273ec4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9167be2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9167be2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Here is the same content with only minor corrections for punctuation and consistency:</p><blockquote><p>Our school, following the NCERT syllabus, prepares students for the All India Secondary School Examination (AISSE) and the Senior School Certificate Examination (SSCE) conducted by the Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE).</p><p>The medium of instruction is English, and the curriculum includes:</p></blockquote>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2519f18 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"2519f18\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\"><div id=\"footable_parent_15963\"\n         class=\" footable_parent ninja_table_wrapper loading_ninja_table wp_table_data_press_parent semantic_ui \">\n                <table data-ninja_table_instance=\"ninja_table_instance_0\" data-footable_id=\"15963\" data-filter-delay=\"1000\" aria-label=\"Course Offered\"            id=\"footable_15963\"\n           data-unique_identifier=\"ninja_table_unique_id_4187408312_15963\"\n           class=\" foo-table ninja_footable foo_table_15963 ninja_table_unique_id_4187408312_15963 ui table ninja_search_right nt_type_ajax_table selectable striped vertical_centered footable-paging-right\">\n                <c